  "bio": "Abel Miranda, based in Barcelona, Spain, is a highly skilled tattoo artist who specializes in the distinctive 'trashpolka' style. His mastery of the abstract form boasts of brush strokes, paint drops tattoos, and has earned him a substantial following of over 65,000 on Instagram. He makes his brilliance known at the sublime Avantgarde Tattoo Collective, where his work epitomizes professionalism and cleanliness."
